{"seq":1,"slug":"image-embedding-match","title":"商品图像 embedding 与相似检索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/voice-visual-search/visual-search/image-embedding-match","wordCount":3087,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"商品图像-embedding-与相似检索\">商品图像 embedding 与相似检索</h1><p>以图搜物的核心是一句话：把「像不像」变成一个可计算的数。这句话听起来简单，但拆开就会发现两个隐含问题必须回答——「像」是相对于什么标准而言的，以及这个标准由谁来定义。对通用图像检索，答案是「视觉上相似」；对商品检索，答案要窄得多：用户拍一件外套想找的是<strong>同一款或可替代的款</strong>，而不是「任何一件视觉上相似的外套」。同款与可替代款的差异往往不在整体观感上，而在几个关键属性——领型、袖长、面料纹理、五金件的形状。这决定了商品图 embedding 的训练目标、数据构造和评测方式都与通用视觉模型不同。</p>\n<p>本文讨论查询图与商品图如何被映射到同一空间、这个空间如何被训练得对电商属性敏感，以及相似度计算本身的工程细节。图片进入模型之前的裁剪与主体检测见 <a href=\"object-detect-crop\">主体检测、抠图与多目标</a>，这些向量如何被索引与在线服务见 <a href=\"visual-index-serving\">图像向量索引与在线服务</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-双塔结构与共享空间\">核心概念：双塔结构与共享空间</h2><p>标准的以图搜图由一对编码器构成：查询图编码器 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与商品图编码器 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，它们把各自的输入映射到同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 维单位球面上。检索就是在这个球面上找夹角最小的点：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s(q, g) = \\cos(f_q(q), f_g(g)) = \\frac{f_q(q)^{\\top} f_g(g)}{\\|f_q(q)\\| \\, \\|f_g(g)\\|}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4982em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5261em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>商品图编码器对全目录离线跑一次，产出几亿个向量；查询图编码器只处理进来的那一次拍摄。这个不对称性是<strong>双塔架构的全部意义</strong>：代价高的部分（商品侧）离线一次性完成，线上部分只做一次前向和一次近邻搜索。任何把查询图与商品图做交叉交互的模型（cross-encoder 式）都无法用于召回阶段，因为它要求对每个候选做一次前向——这在百万级目录上不可行。交叉交互只能用在候选集已经收敛到几十条之后的精排阶段。</p>\n<p>训练目标是让「同一商品的不同图片」在球面上彼此靠近，让「不同商品」彼此远离。这本质上是一个对比学习目标，与 CLIP 的图文对比训练同源。CLIP 的论文（Radford 等，2021，arXiv:2103.00020）给出的规模参照是：在 4 亿对互联网图文上训练，在 30 多个视觉数据集上评估零样本迁移能力，其中在 ImageNet 上以零样本方式达到了原始 ResNet-50 的准确率（后者用了 128 万张有标注训练样本；来源：CLIP 论文, <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2103.00020）。这个数字说明了对比学习路线的可行性，但电商场景不能直接照搬——CLIP\">https://arxiv.org/abs/2103.00020）。这个数字说明了对比学习路线的可行性，但电商场景不能直接照搬——CLIP</a> 的监督信号是「图片与这句描述匹配」，而商品检索的监督信号应该是「这两张图是同一个 SKU」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[商品目录图片] --&gt; B[商品图编码器 f_g]&#10;    B --&gt; C[离线批处理]&#10;    C --&gt; D[(向量库&lt;br/&gt;亿级向量)]&#10;    E[用户拍摄图片] --&gt; F[主体检测与裁剪]&#10;    F --&gt; G[查询图编码器 f_q]&#10;    G --&gt; H[查询向量]&#10;    H --&gt; I[近邻检索 top-K]&#10;    D --&gt; I&#10;    I --&gt; J[候选商品集合]&#10;    J --&gt; K[精排: 属性校验 / 交叉编码]&#10;    K --&gt; L[结果页]&#10;    G -.共享权重或对齐训练.-&gt; B\">graph TD\n    A[商品目录图片] --&gt; B[商品图编码器 f_g]\n    B --&gt; C[离线批处理]\n    C --&gt; D[(向量库&lt;br/&gt;亿级向量)]\n    E[用户拍摄图片] --&gt; F[主体检测与裁剪]\n    F --&gt; G[查询图编码器 f_q]\n    G --&gt; H[查询向量]\n    H --&gt; I[近邻检索 top-K]\n    D --&gt; I\n    I --&gt; J[候选商品集合]\n    J --&gt; K[精排: 属性校验 / 交叉编码]\n    K --&gt; L[结果页]\n    G -.共享权重或对齐训练.-&gt; B</pre><p>图中虚线是架构选择点：查询编码器与商品编码器可以是<strong>共享权重</strong>的同一个模型，也可以是各自独立的双塔。共享权重的好处是参数少、训练数据需求低、天然在同一空间；独立双塔的灵活之处在于查询侧可以针对「手机拍摄的扭曲、光照、角度」做专门适配，而商品侧保持干净的棚拍分布。实践中独立双塔在电商场景更常见——因为两侧的数据分布差异（棚拍 vs 随手拍）比通用检索里大得多。</p>\n<h2 id=\"训练目标与难负样本-为什么难负样本决定上限\">训练目标与难负样本：为什么难负样本决定上限</h2><p>对比学习的损失函数通常取 InfoNCE 形式。设一个 batch 内有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个正样本对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(q_i, g_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，温度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>τ</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>τ</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L} = -\\frac{1}{N} \\sum_{i=1}^{N} \\log \\frac{\\exp\\!\\left(s(q_i, g_i)/\\tau\\right)}{\\sum_{j=1}^{N} \\exp\\!\\left(s(q_i, g_j)/\\tau\\right)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1354em;vertical-align:-1.307em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1288em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9812em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.307em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>分式的分母把 batch 内所有其他商品当作负样本。这个形式有一个致命的实践问题：<strong>随机采样的负样本太容易区分了</strong>。一个 batch 里随机凑在一起的商品，绝大多数在视觉上毫无关系（充电器与连衣裙），模型只要学会「衣服和电子产品的粗略区分」就能让损失下降，而完全不需要学会「V 领和圆领的区别」——而后者才是用户真正在乎的。</p>\n<p>解决方式是构造<strong>难负样本</strong>（hard negatives），负样本的来源按难度递增：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>负样本类型</th>\n<th>构造方式</th>\n<th>难度</th>\n<th>训练价值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>随机负样本</td>\n<td>batch 内随机商品</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>低，很快饱和</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同品类负样本</td>\n<td>同三级类目下的其他商品</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中，学品类内区分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>属性难负样本</td>\n<td>同类目但关键属性不同</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高，学属性敏感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同款不同色</td>\n<td>同一 SPU 的其他颜色</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>极高，学颜色敏感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同图不同 SKU</td>\n<td>视觉几乎一致的相似款</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>高，但需人工审核</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>倒数第二行「同款不同色」是电商场景最有价值也最容易得到的难负样本——商品目录本身就记录了 SPU 与 SKU 的层级关系，同一个 SPU 下颜色不同的商品图天然构成一对「几乎相同但必须被区分」的样本。用这类样本训练能把颜色敏感性直接压进向量空间，而这是通用视觉模型最容易忽略的维度（很多通用 embedding 对颜色变化不敏感，因为颜色在通用语义里往往不是区分性特征）。</p>\n<p>构造难负样本时必须防一类坑：<strong>假负样本</strong>（false negative）。目录里存在大量实际相同但被拆成不同 SPU 的商品（同一供应商的重复铺货），如果把它们当作负样本，模型会被训练去区分本该相同的两件东西。缓解手段是在构造负样本时用类目、标题、图片哈希做一次过滤，剔除高度重叠的候选。这一步的投入产出比很高，工业界常见的做法是先用一个较宽松的过滤（如标题 token 重合度超过阈值即剔除），再对剩下的做人工抽样审核。</p>\n<h2 id=\"相似度的工程细节\">相似度的工程细节</h2><p><strong>归一化</strong>。用余弦相似度时，向量必须在入库前 L2 归一化，否则模长会污染内积。归一化位置有一个容易错的地方：如果用 Matryoshka 式可截断向量（见下），截断之后必须重新归一化——截断改变了模长。HuggingFace 关于 MRL 的文档明确指出：生成截断向量本身并不更快（模型仍要算出完整向量，取小向量的耗时与大向量相同），收益在存储与下游任务（检索、聚类等）的处理速度，并且「如果原本做了归一化，截断之后就不再是归一化的，所以你可能需要重新归一化」（来源：HuggingFace Matryoshka 博客, <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/blog/matryoshka）。\">https://huggingface.co/blog/matryoshka）。</a></p>\n<p><strong>维数与可截断性</strong>。向量维度直接决定存储与检索成本：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个商品、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 维、FP32 精度需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4nd</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 字节。一亿商品 512 维 FP32 是 204.8GB，这个量级让「全部放内存」变成一个昂贵的选择，索引方案的取舍见 <a href=\"visual-index-serving\">图像向量索引与在线服务</a>。Matryoshka Representation Learning（Kusupati 等，arXiv:2205.13147）提出了一种缓解手段：训练时对同一向量在多个维度前缀上同时施加损失，使向量的前若干维本身就构成一个可用的低维表示。该论文报告在 ImageNet-1K 分类上匹配精度时向量可缩小最多 14 倍，大规模检索上最多 14 倍加速（来源：MRL 论文, <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2205.13147）。MRL\">https://arxiv.org/abs/2205.13147）。MRL</a> 的工程含义是：<strong>粗排用截断的低维向量，精排用完整向量</strong>，两级检索共享同一份存储的完整向量，粗排只是在读取时少读几个维度（如果采用分离存储）或直接用完整向量算但只在低维上比较。</p>\n<p><strong>相似度不等于相关性的情形</strong>。有三类查询会让余弦相似度失效，必须在检索之外用别的信号兜住：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>跨品类视觉相似</strong>：米色地毯与米色针织衫在低维空间里可能极近。对策是把品类预测作为前置过滤器（多个索引分片按品类隔离，只在预测品类及其邻近品类内检索）。</li>\n<li><strong>同款但角度极端</strong>：用户只拍到了商品的背面或局部。对策是多视角商品图入库（一件商品存多张图的多个向量），以及查询侧的裁剪与旋转增强。</li>\n<li><strong>非商品主体占主导</strong>：用户随手拍的照片里，背景的图案比商品更显著。这类查询的失败根源在预处理层，见 <a href=\"object-detect-crop\">主体检测、抠图与多目标</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"评测-用业务指标而不是学术指标\">评测：用业务指标而不是学术指标</h2><p>图像检索的学术评测常用 mAP、Recall@K，这些指标在电商场景必须重新定义「什么算相关」。一个实用的评测集构造方法是：从线上真实拍摄的查询图中采样几千条，对每条人工标注「同款」「可替代款」「不相关」三档，然后统计：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>为什么需要</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Recall@20（同款）</td>\n<td>同款商品出现在前 20 的比例</td>\n<td>衡量核心能力上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Recall@20（可替代款）</td>\n<td>可替代款出现在前 20 的比例</td>\n<td>衡量召回丰富度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>品类纯净度</td>\n<td>前 20 中品类正确的比例</td>\n<td>衡量是否被跨品类相似污染</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>属性命中率</td>\n<td>前 20 中关键属性一致的比例</td>\n<td>衡量属性敏感性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>首条相关性</td>\n<td>第一条结果属于同款或可替代款的比例</td>\n<td>用户最直观的感受</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>零结果率</td>\n<td>无候选的查询占比</td>\n<td>索引覆盖与阈值设置问题</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行「零结果率」在图像检索里常被忽略，因为向量检索几乎总能返回 top-K——它不返回零结果，只返回不相关的结果。所以这个指标要重新定义为「最高相似度低于某阈值」的查询占比，用于发现索引覆盖的盲区（例如某类商品根本没有入库，或者主体检测在某种拍摄方式下系统性失败）。</p>\n<p>另一个必须建立的能力是<strong>归因</strong>：一条查询失败时，要能区分它是编码器的问题、预处理的问题、还是索引的问题。做法是在链路上打三个点：记录裁剪后送入编码器的图、记录编码器输出的向量、记录检索返回的原始候选。三者串起来的日志是定位问题的唯一手段，而这些素材的留存策略要遵守隐私规范——见 <a href=\"../capture-client/camera-audio-capture\">拍照/录音采集与权限</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>双塔架构的意义在于<strong>不对称计算</strong>：商品侧离线批处理，查询侧线上单次前向；交叉交互只能放在候选收敛后的精排。</li>\n<li>商品检索的训练目标不能用通用图文对比，监督信号应当是「同一个 SKU」；<strong>同款不同色</strong>这类来自目录层级的难负样本价值最高。</li>\n<li>构造难负样本时必须过滤<strong>假负样本</strong>（重复铺货），否则模型被训练去区分本该相同的东西。</li>\n<li>余弦相似度要求前置<strong>L2 归一化</strong>；使用可截断的 MRL 向量时，截断后必须重新归一化。</li>\n<li>余弦相似度在<strong>跨品类视觉相似、极端视角、非商品主体主导</strong>三类情形下失效，需要用品类预测、多视角入库、预处理分别兜住。</li>\n<li>评测必须用「同款 / 可替代款 / 不相关」三档的人工标注，而不是学术 mAP；同时把「零结果」重新定义为「最高相似度低于阈值」。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>向量算出来只是开始，它们在几亿规模下如何被存下与检索，见 <a href=\"visual-index-serving\">图像向量索引与在线服务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"商品图像 embedding 与相似检索","id":"商品图像-embedding-与相似检索"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：双塔结构与共享空间","id":"核心概念-双塔结构与共享空间"},{"level":2,"text":"训练目标与难负样本：为什么难负样本决定上限","id":"训练目标与难负样本-为什么难负样本决定上限"},{"level":2,"text":"相似度的工程细节","id":"相似度的工程细节"},{"level":2,"text":"评测：用业务指标而不是学术指标","id":"评测-用业务指标而不是学术指标"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"口语化查询改写为商品检索词","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/voice-visual-search/voice-search/spoken-query-rewrite"},"next":{"title":"主体检测、抠图与多目标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/voice-visual-search/visual-search/object-detect-crop"}}